---
import { REPAIR_WORK_ORDER_FLOW } from '@/data/service/repair-workshop'
---

<section class="repair-process repair-section" aria-labelledby="repair-process-heading">
  <div class="redesign-shell">
    <header class="repair-section__heading">
      <p class="redesign-kicker">从评估到交付</p>
      <h2 id="repair-process-heading">修复完成之后，还要通过品牌标准。</h2>
    </header>
    <ol class="repair-process__steps">
      {
        REPAIR_WORK_ORDER_FLOW.map(({ num, title, desc }) => (
          <li>
            <p>{num}</p>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <span>{desc}</span>
          </li>
        ))
      }
    </ol>
    <div class="repair-process__outcomes" aria-label="二次质检后的两种处理结果">
      <div>
        <strong>达到品牌确认标准</strong>
        <p>进入约定的上架或后续授权流程。</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <strong>未达到确认标准</strong>
        <p>按约定继续处理或分流。</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
